WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:09.790
<i>The countless flowers,
enveloped in light…</i>

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:20.320
<i>…gaze at tomorrow
with unwavering eyes.</i>

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:39.350
<i>Everyone wishes for me to be pure…</i>

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:46.810
<i>…but what can I bring
with me to the frayed skies?</i>

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:53.900
<i>What I’ve made my own
by breaking off flowers in bloom…</i>

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:59.510
<i>All such sinful things…</i>

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:06.990
<i>Why did I stop making
promises with the future?</i>

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:14.260
<i>Because even if I try
to run far from all the pain…</i>

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:20.990
<i>…a cold wind rustles
my hair… Don’t you see?</i>

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:28.430
<i>Where can I ever find the answer?</i>

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.280
It would be too
dangerous to sit back…

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.990
…and do nothing about
that mobile air base.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:40.120
We are hereby sending the Chor
Tempest on a reconnaissance mission.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.490
The Messis shall serve
as the relay point…

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:45.040
And if we discover the base?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.390
That will be left to
your discretion, but…

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.250
As for me…

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:52.750
I do believe you have the capacity
to blow it up at this point.

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:07.970
Why do you think they
took you off the mission?

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:10.440
I have a pretty good idea.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.490
You do, huh?

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:12.730
What about you?

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.230
There’s something that I
can’t quite put my finger on.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:15.280
And what would that be?

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:17.500
I can’t tell you.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.280
Because I promised not to.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:27.750
I’ve got to go now.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.790
As do I.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:35.800
<b>Sibylla</b>

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.190
As if Sibylla Aer would
ever do as she’s told.

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:49.360
Are you really
going to let this go?

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.810
Honestly, this makes me wonder
what the sibyllae are thinking.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.350
You’re absolutely right.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:59.220
What I would give for that
kind of single-minded passion…

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.500
What is the meaning
of that Simoun?

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:05.280
Captain!

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.790
Who’s that?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.700
I believe it’s Sibylla
Aer and Sibylla Yun.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.670
I see.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.170
Sibylla Aer and Sibylla Yun.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.300
Vura!

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:38.480
After Chor Rubor was
disbanded, these two sibyllae…

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.490
…were assigned to the
Messis as your replacements…

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:45.370
…and have been on
reconnaissance duty ever since.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.490
Good job.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.700
This is all that we have
to offer at this point.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.390
We heard about Dominüra and Rimone.

00:03:54.390 --> 00:03:56.340
But where are Aer and Yun?

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:00.050
Those two will be
sitting out this mission.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.930
There’ll be plenty of
time to discuss that later.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.800
Sibyllae, won’t you
please come inside.

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:08.810
We should go over the
details of our mission, and…

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:12.810
First of all, I’d like
you to get some rest.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.320
It’s a little early,
but I’m going on ahead.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.440
I’ll meet you in the
dining room in half an hour.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:24.320
Right. I’ll be along soon.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.550
Oh, it’s you, Roatre!
What’s going on?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.550
Well, you were
taking so long, Mamina!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.690
Was I?

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.550
Let’s go!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.270
Oh, Mamina.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.270
What? What’s wrong?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.730
Your braids are
starting to come undone!

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.020
What?

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.190
I’ll fix them for you.
We still have time anyway!

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:15.710
Those Simouns we
saw at the Ruins…

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:19.640
…do you think they’ve made it
back to the highlands’ base station?

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:20.960
Probably.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.540
But there’s nothing to worry about.

00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:25.720
You’re paired up with Morinas,
and she’s an excellent auriga.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.470
Yes, she is.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.150
And even if something
should go wrong somehow…

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:31.850
…I’ll be there to protect you!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:32.970
Right.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.940
Even so…

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.770
This is just a reconnaissance
mission after all.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.940
It would be better if we could avoid
going into battle at all, wouldn’t it?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.240
Yes, it would.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:51.160
That would be the
best of all, right?

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.200
Right!

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:55.010
Thanks to the data these two
have gathered on patrol…

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:58.950
…we’ve narrowed down the Shoukoku
air base’s approximate location…

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.210
…to this region right here.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.710
In those defenseless Similes?

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:07.190
Sibylla Aurea, we two will
hold the rearguard position…

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.180
…and relay all
communications from the Messis.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.220
The rest…

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.350
I know.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.470
The rest is up to us.

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.330
There’s no getting around the fact
that the gap between the Similes…

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.500
…and the Simouns in terms
of mobility is far too great.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.810
Putting together a mixed unit like
this… It’s just not feasible.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.610
Just leave it to us!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.030
There you go making rash
promises again, Floe.

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.900
What do you mean “again”?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.780
Would you knock it off?
Both of you!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:31.240
But Alty’s the one who…

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.020
Let’s try to get along, people!

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:40.210
Come on, we’re comrades. We all
ate from the same pot, remember?

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.750
Don’t say it, Mamina!

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.200
Oh, um, don’t mind me…

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.470
Please continue, Captain.

00:06:49.950 --> 00:06:51.090
Very well.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:53.830
First, we’ll have the
members of Chor Tempest…

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.000
That Mamina’s changed, hasn’t she?

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:57.020
Yes.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.460
By the way, what did you
not want her to say, Roatre?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.590
The mice.

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.520
Who knew Vura was flying
reconnaissance in a Simile?

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:12.870
I had no idea.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:16.740
Right, and to make sure their
efforts don’t go to waste…

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:19.750
…the rest of us need to be
in top form during this mission.

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:32.680
Sibylla Aurea, this is where
we’re supposed to deploy.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.680
You’re right.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.640
Then we’re going to proceed
according to plan. Understood?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.660
Roger!

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:50.730
How can the center deploy
Chor Tempest in this state?

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:54.240
It’s just as Sibylla
Dominüra said to me once.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.200
The center understands nothing!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:03.600
It will be a while before
Chor Tempest returns.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:06.460
I’d like you both to get
some rest while you can.

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:10.170
It’s part of our duty
to rest… correct?

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.150
That’s correct, Sibylla.

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.100
Make sure you don’t miss any
signs of Chor Tempest’s return.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.600
I want you to reiterate
that to the patrol unit!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.640
Yes, sir!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.400
Mamina…

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:32.320
They forbade you from attending
Anglas’s funeral, didn’t they?

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.770
That is rather harsh of our
country, don’t you think?

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:37.740
Oh, no, Sibylla Aurea.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.270
The more tenuous a state
they find themselves in…

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:44.230
…the more people try to cling to
the comfort of their conventions.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.920
You’re right.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:49.550
Mamina, I can see that
you’ve changed after all.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.630
Do you think so?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.520
Gimme a break!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:58.040
“I’m detaching the cables for
the time being.” So she says!

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.430
How annoying is that?

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:03.700
So they must be having a private
conversation one adult to another.

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:04.940
I say leave them alone.

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:09.690
3 o’clock! There’s a huge shadow
in that break in the clouds.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.490
There.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.700
Found it!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.620
We’re going to keep the
communication cables intact…

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:30.290
…and approach from above.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.290
What?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.960
But we’ve found the base.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.830
Those Simouns we encountered
at the Ruins could be here.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.030
We should find out for sure.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:37.960
Right.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:41.100
Let’s just confirm that
before we head home, Floe.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.220
Okay.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.970
Don’t let down your guard!

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.730
There’s a chance that the enemy
could be patrolling this area too.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:47.730
Right.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.560
Nothing here.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.940
If we go much farther, we’ll be
leaving the patrol area, Para-sama.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.890
Don’t you think we
should be heading back…

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.700
…to our rendezvous
point with the regina?

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:40.700
Para-sama?

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:50.710
Let’s patrol this
area a little longer.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.040
Roger!

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.260
There it is! The Messis!

00:11:07.070 --> 00:11:09.390
To the rear of our ship.
A single Simoun!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.980
Approaching at a rapid pace.
It’s a Chor Tempest Simoun!

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:14.990
Who are they?

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.480
It’s Aer and Yun!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.200
Vura!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:26.120
Who would’ve thought we’d
find Vura on board the Messis?

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.200
Yes, it’s quite surprising.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.540
Understood.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.040
Actually, I was worried
about that myself.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:37.170
Sibylla Aer and Sibylla
Yun, please go on ahead.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.280
Right.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.640
Please, be careful.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:40.670
Thanks!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:47.680
Captain!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.730
I thought they might show up.

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:50.600
So?

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.730
Yes. Let’s head that way ourselves.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:57.190
Channel all power from the
helical motors to the engines!

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.320
We’re heading for the
patrol zone at top speed!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.280
Yes, sir!

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:12.370
Hey, Para-sama!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:15.960
Para-sama!

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:20.380
We’re heading toward the
rendezvous point with the regina.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.130
— Right!
— Roger!

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.500
No, they’ve spotted us!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.000
Retreat at top speed!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:09.600
Para-sama, behind us!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.020
Para-sama!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:22.530
Come on, let’s get going!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.530
Roger!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:24.530
Right!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.510
We’re going to keep going!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.550
Shark Ri Majon!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.550
Roger! Shark Ri Majon!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.190
Can’t shake them off!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.560
Those guys are way too fast!

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:11.490
She just…

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.740
Neviril just told us
to make a run for it!

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.500
But…

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.740
Hurry!

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.920
We should do as she says!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.290
Otherwise, both our
Simouns will be shot down.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.160
We’ve got to hurry back
and let the others know.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.670
They’re coming after us!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.310
Hang in there. We’ll come
back for you as soon as we can!

00:15:20.990 --> 00:15:22.190
Sibylla Aurea!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.190
Neviril!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.120
Sibylla Aurea…

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.460
Please have no fear.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.830
No matter what it takes, I’ll…

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:04.060
If you can understand what I’m
saying, then listen to me now!

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:07.650
I’m nothing but
an unknown sibylla…

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.780
…doomed to die in
such a place as this.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.610
What do I care
about my own life?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.780
But…

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:19.500
Behind me lies the finest sibylla
in all of Simulacrum Kyuukoku…

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.870
…Sibylla Aurea Neviril!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.290
I’m getting her out
of here no matter what.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:28.340
And not one of you will lay
so much as a finger on her!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.260
No.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:33.380
Both the sibylla behind you…

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.300
…and you yourself are
the finest of all sibyllae.

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:40.560
You two are sibyllae
from Simulacrum Kyuukoku.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.890
There’s no one closer
to God than you.

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.930
In our nation,
the Plumbum highlands…

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:48.900
…you are respected
above all others.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:54.110
It is not our choice to
engage in battle with you.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:58.650
And it is not our will to
capture an injured sibylla.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.620
You…

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:04.660
We are priestesses of
the Plumbum Highlands.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:08.330
We’re not the same as the Shoukoku
soldiers on board this ship.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.460
The battle we have just
been waging is already over.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.880
There is no longer any
reason for us to fight.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.300
Please, you must believe us.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.930
If we were planning
to capture you…

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.640
…then there would be no need
for us to go to all these lengths.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.730
Mamina…

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.820
Sibylla Aurea?

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:35.810
What those priestesses
are telling us…

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.240
I am sure it is the truth.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.500
Please, you must hurry!

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:52.500
Right.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.240
Come, together now.

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:14.100
There’s no time to lose!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.030
Right.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.040
So that’s what’s
going to happen.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.830
If you four let us get
away from this base…

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:27.900
…you’ll have nowhere to go.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.250
No. If they capture you,
you are certain to be killed!

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:45.930
You four recognized
me as a true sibylla!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:51.440
And if you let me escape, you’ll
be put to death as traitors!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.450
Farewell, Sibylla Aurea.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.260
Are you out of your mind?

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:34.660
If you’re planning to go to your
death at the hands of those soldiers…

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:36.320
…then let me!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:39.140
This is how it should be.

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:41.480
It’s what I want.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.030
Let me say it in your language…

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.040
Aer…

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.070
Aer!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:05.590
We’ve sighted a huge
shadow straight ahead.

00:20:05.590 --> 00:20:07.510
Captain, we believe it’s
Shoukoku’s aerial base!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.300
And it appears to be on fire!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.520
All hands, take your
positions for battle level one!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.520
All hands, take your
positions for battle level one!

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:44.470
No, it’s not true.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.810
All hands, brace
yourself for impact!

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.070
All hands, brace
yourself for impact!

00:20:52.070 --> 00:20:54.650
Come on, we’re going
to the priestesses’ aid!

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:35.590
Mamina!

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.730
Let’s hurry back
to the Messis!

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:38.560
Right.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.050
— No!
— Step back, Roatreamon!

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:42.490
— You’re in our way!
— Hurry!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.740
Mamina!

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:44.980
Roatreamon!

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:46.070
Aer!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.070
Come on, let’s go, Roatreamon!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.580
We’ve got to hurry too, Aer.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.870
Aer!

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:56.290
We’ve got to get away from
here! We’ve got to run!

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:00.790
We can’t afford to just stand
here forever, don’t you see?

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:24.440
Sibylla!

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:26.180
Sibylla!

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:47.950
<i>It is played by my wounds…
the song of prayer.</i>

00:22:47.950 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>Let it ring out over
the grieving universe.</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:59.260
<i>Can we change tomorrow?
Don’t be afraid.</i>

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:06.850
<i>I want to let you know
how my heart’s overflowing.</i>

00:23:15.670 --> 00:23:19.740
<i>“I want to get closer to you.”
“I want to feel your pulse.”</i>

00:23:19.740 --> 00:23:24.920
<i>I was too defiant,
and I took the long way around.</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.890
<i>The blue moon is swaying silently.</i>

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:32.930
<i>My true heart’s desire is you.</i>

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:38.800
<i>I can’t reach you.
My tears of pain trickle down.</i>

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.340
<i>Soar away into the
sky, song of prayer.</i>

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:47.780
<i>Carrying my love that came too late.</i>

00:23:47.780 --> 00:23:53.440
<i>What can I do to change tomorrow?</i>

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:59.670
<i>Just hold on to “now” the way it is…</i>

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:06.670
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:07.470
She was a proud sibylla…

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:11.260
…not to mention just a young
girl from Simulacrum Kyuukoku.

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:13.800
And now Sibylla Mamina is dead.

00:24:13.800 --> 00:24:15.510
Next time on Simoun…

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:20.020
<b>Lament</b>

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:17.890
Lament.
